#NEXUS

[ thompson2011a_fig2: Ankylosaurian strict consensus (panel A). Large polytomies: 25 nodosaurids and early ankylosaurs on one vertical, and a 12-branch ankylosaurid node beside Zhongyuansaurus + Tsagantegia. The tip labels sit between the two trees, so panel B's branches end at the same labels from the right. 51 tips, 3 polytomies (3, 12, 25 children). Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

